          "sectionId": 27015
        }
      ],
      "title": "闪耀迪迦·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27016001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "喂，你们这群蠢猫，有本事就来找我麻烦，在那里欺负小孩算什么本事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "很多猫",
          "text": "喵！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "可恶，这群臭猫还真是不客气……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "竟然一下子就来了这么一大群，迪迦，本王给你争取到机会了，你要是错过的话，我会很生气的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "很多猫",
          "text": "喵！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "不能浪费莉可争取的时间，我要打败它们，救出他。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016008",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "然后像是莉可所说的那样，等他睁开眼睛的时候，只要我守护在他身边……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "但是……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "唔啊啊，这陷阱怎么又失效了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "可恶，你们这群臭猫，本王和你们拼了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "等，等等，我错了，你们这么多只猫偷袭我一只小手办，太过分了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "救……不行，现在喊救命的话，就要前功尽弃了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这个声音，迪迦……为什么你会在这里啊？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不是说了让你好好待在那家伙身边就好了吗，这可是你被重新带回去的机会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "本王现在的情况是游刃有余，才没有要让你担心！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你还是好好担心你自己吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27016022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-598",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
