        }
      ],
      "title": "闪耀迪迦·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27017001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你不是还要摆脱这副模样吗，现在不回到你主人身边，凭你那黑暗的样子，可没法再被他收留吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017003",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "我已经放弃了。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017004",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "单纯追求去除外表的黑暗，是错误的。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "任何一个人都有黑暗面，但是重要的是我们的心里除了黑暗还有光明的一面。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "如果我舍弃莉可，换取被主人认可的机会，那才是真正的向着黑暗堕落。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "那就算被带回去，也没有意义。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017008",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "而且比起这个，我想我也已经找到了真正的光明是什么。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "莉可和主人都是这样，你们都有自己的黑暗面，但也有着自己的光明。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017010",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "主人知错就改，莉可你一直想做魔王，但在实际行动上总会表现出自己的正义和包容，只有我自己执迷不悟，太过执着自己外表的黑暗。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017011",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "太过沉迷于想要找到光的我，会被这份贪婪的黑暗所包裹，也是理所当然的事情。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017012",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "不过从现在开始，我不会再执着于这一切。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017013",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "即便是黑暗的模样，但只要用这份力量去做正确的事情，那就是真正的光明。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这种时候就不要说这种帅气的话了……唔！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "等等！迪迦……你身上……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "在发光？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017018",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "我感觉到了，制造出我们的涂料本身就是爱和希望的聚合，代表光的力量。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "所以……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这就是迪迦你要寻找的光明吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017021",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "是的。原来……光一直都在我的身上，只是我一直没曾发现。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27017022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27023001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "很多猫",
          "text": "喵！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-599",
