      "title": "闪耀迪迦·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27018001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这就……结束了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "竟然只是一个人就打败了这么多麻烦的猫，你还真是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不过看起来，你好像比黑乎乎的时候，更加厉害了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018004",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "这就是爱和希望的力量。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "最关键的是，有了战斗的理由。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "使用这份希望想要为了守护什么战斗的时候，力量就会源源不断的涌出来。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这么离谱的解释，我才不要相信。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不过现在……你既然变成了这副样子，那就可以回去了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "谢谢你，莉可。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我都说了，不用谢了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你真的要感激的话，以后来做我的对手好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "现在，你还有更重要的事情去做吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "去吧，不用管我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27018015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你的主人还在等着你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
