    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27019001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "我……这是在做梦吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "刚才，我好像被一堆可恶的猫包围了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "被猫抓了要打狂犬疫苗，我，我不要打针……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "这个是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "为什么迪迦会在这里？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "噢噢噢！！迪迦在发光，黑色的迪迦！！竟然变成了光明的形态？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "嗷！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "好痛，这不是做梦，就算这样用力的掐自己，我也没有醒来，这是真的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "我要去告诉爸爸妈妈！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "我是被选中的孩子，我的光唤醒了迪迦身上的光。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "砰！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "妈妈！！！你看我找到了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "妈妈",
          "text": "我都说了多少遍了，不要踹门！！你的手是给你白长的了是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "妈妈",
          "text": "不过你来的正好，你丢进垃圾桶里的不及格试卷你要怎么解释？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "啊？？你找到的是哪一门课的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "妈妈",
          "text": "哪一门课？？？你有几门不及格的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "妈妈",
          "text": "孩子他爸！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孩子",
          "text": "等等，先让我把迪迦收好你们再打……嗷！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "最终，兴冲冲回到家想要和父母分享自己迪迦拥有自己变换形态能力的熊孩子给父母混合双打教训了一顿。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27019021",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "不过想要作为大魔王的莉可意外和正义的奥特曼成为了朋友。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
